{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-G1_native_gate_review_20260925-170100.md'; Get-Content -TotalCount 120 'pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-G1_label_alignment_16scenes_20260925.json'; Get-Content -TotalCount 130 'AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_q1_token_attention.py'; Get-Content 'AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/loss.py' | Select-Object -Skip 170 -First 50\"","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES-G1 native gate review\n\n2026-09-25 17:01 Asia/Shanghai. Fixed B4-E30 checkpoint and first 16\nScanRefer validation scenes (441 expressions), then native training pairs on\nserver-2 GPU1. No validation-derived threshold or weight is selected.\n\n| Gate | Evidence | Assessment |\n|---|---|---|\n| Diagnosis | B4 seed/object matched labels disagree with mask quality: among 240 material top-1 errors, 37 selected-positive/oracle-negative pairs. The oracle is positive in 147 errors and the selected query in 54. | Pass as a bounded mismatch; not a causal efficacy claim. |\n| Controls | G1 and B4 configs are byte-identical (SHA256 `1a170434f63da98e10f59c5b17473cde5cf3ff6be0e4381e2771f322853ffa03`); independent package differs only in indicator target computation. | Historical B4-E30 is a fixed 30-epoch continuation control, not a fresh seed-matched run. |\n| Native backward | Target test confirms a high-IoU seed-negative query gets positive gradient and a zero-IoU seed-positive query gets negative gradient; target mask detached. Native [0,1] and [256,257] losses finite with nonzero indicator/decoder gradients. | Pass for tested native batches. |\n| Resources | G1 [0,1] 19.67s, 4.75 GiB reserved; B4 19.63s, 4.75 GiB. G1 [256,257] 24.05s, 6.396 GiB; B4 24.01s, 6.396 GiB. | Pass bounded one-card 24 GiB budget; not worst-case or final throughput. |\n| Independence | G1 changes training indicator target from seed/object membership to detached per-query mask IoU; C1/C2 add listwise/hinge objectives while retaining B4's seed indicator labels, D1 changes rival context, F4 changes decoder neighborhoods. Separate model package and unique config basename. | Distinct causal question, no cross-variant imports. |\n| Constraints | Released backbone, same B4 architecture/config, fresh 30 epochs, only server-2 GPU0/1, single-GPU task, no validation scanning. | Pass. |\n\nNative readouts: [0,1] G1 loss 13.39095, indicator/out_norm gradient\nnorms 3.29086/0.68412, allocated 4.41259 GiB; B4 loss 13.62251,\ngradients 2.47664/0.68415. [256,257] G1 loss 10.86048, gradients\n2.48718/0.91176, allocated 5.87275 GiB; B4 loss 11.08767,\ngradients 1.65840/0.91182. Tests validate mechanism activity, not\ngeneralization or a memory maximum.\n\nThe diagnostic reconstructs seed membership from validation instance labels\nfor analysis only. Training G1's target uses training masks exclusively.\nThe supervision target depends on current mask quality but is stop-gradient,\nso improvement requires learning from changing predictions and could be\nunstable. B4-E30 is not a fresh matched training seed control. Literature\nnovelty and a formal derivation have not been established.\n\r\n{\r\n  \"checkpoint\": \"/bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth\",\r\n  \"scenes\": 16,\r\n  \"expressions\": 441,\r\n  \"material_errors\": 240,\r\n  \"error_selected_positive_oracle_negative\": 37,\r\n  \"error_oracle_positive\": 147,\r\n  \"error_selected_positive\": 54,\r\n  \"mean_positive_fraction\": 0.038477891156462586,\r\n  \"rows\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.9489414691925049,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 4,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 8,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 5\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.9579967856407166,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 4,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 7,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 13\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.8131248354911804,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 3,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 8,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 9\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.5941828489303589,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.722623884677887,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": true,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": false,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 7,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 1,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": -1\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.9597055315971375,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.9597055315971375,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": true,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 6,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 18,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 18\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.8079261779785156,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": false,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 2,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 2,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 18\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.8299676775932312,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 2,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 2,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 17\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.9560015201568604,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.9914940595626831,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": true,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": false,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 6,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 18,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 17\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.6932852268218994,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.7706700563430786,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": true,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 6,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 25,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 25\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.0,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.9579967856407166,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": false,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 4,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 9,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 13\r\n    },\r\nimport argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor(self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n              gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp):\r\n    weights = self.probe_attention\r\n    if weights.ndim == 4:\r\n        weights = weights.mean(1)\r\n    if weights.ndim != 3 or weights.shape[:2] != out[\"indis\"].shape[:2]:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Unexpected language attention shape: {weights.shape}\")\r\n    valid = self.probe_token_mask.to(weights.device).bool()\r\n    weights = weights.masked_fill(~valid[:, None, :], 0)\r\n    weights = weights / weights.sum(-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(1e-8)\r\n    concentration = weights.square().sum(-1)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n        target_tokens = self.probe_dense_maps[index][\"positive_map\"][0, :weights.shape[-1]]\r\n        target_tokens = target_tokens.to(weights.device).bool() & valid[index]\r\n        token_count = int(valid[index].sum())\r\n        rotated_tokens = torch.zeros_like(target_tokens)\r\n        rotated_tokens[:token_count] = target_tokens[:token_count].roll(1)\r\n        target_mass = weights[index, :, target_tokens].sum(-1)\r\n        rotated_mass = weights[index, :, rotated_tokens].sum(-1)\r\n        masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n        truth = target.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n        ious = (masks & truth).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n            (masks | truth).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n        )\r\n        confidence = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n        selected, oracle = int(confidence.argmax()), int(ious.argmax())\r\n        rows.append({\r\n            \"scene\": self.probe_scene,\r\n            \"selected\": selected,\r\n            \"oracle\": oracle,\r\n            \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n            \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n            \"selected_concentration\": float(concentration[index, selected]),\r\n            \"oracle_concentration\": float(concentration[index, oracle]),\r\n            \"selected_target_mass\": float(target_mass[selected]),\r\n            \"oracle_target_mass\": float(target_mass[oracle]),\r\n            \"selected_rotated_mass\": float(rotated_mass[selected]),\r\n            \"oracle_rotated_mass\": float(rotated_mass[oracle]),\r\n            \"target_tokens\": int(target_tokens.sum()),\r\n            \"concentration_iou\": float(ious[concentration[index].argmax()]),\r\n            \"valid_tokens\": int(valid[index].sum()),\r\n        })\r\n    return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=0)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.train.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n               \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\"}\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n\r\n    def capture(module, inputs, output):\r\n        model.probe_attention = output[1]\r\n\r\n    model.dec.qla_layers[-1].register_forward_hook(capture)\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor, model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    repeat_mismatch = 0\r\n    max_repeat_deviation = 0.0\r\n    for scene in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        batch = dataset.collate_fn([dataset[scene]])\r\n        model.probe_scene = scene\r\n        model.probe_token_mask = batch[\"lang_masks\"]\r\n        model.probe_dense_maps = batch[\"dense_maps\"]\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            base = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n            repeat = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n        for a, b in zip(base, repeat):\r\n            deviation = max(\r\n                abs(a[\"selected_concentration\"] - b[\"selected_concentration\"]),\r\n                abs(a[\"oracle_concentration\"] - b[\"oracle_concentration\"]),\r\n            )\r\n            max_repeat_deviation = max(max_repeat_deviation, deviation)\r\n            repeat_mismatch += (\r\n                a[\"selected\"] != b[\"selected\"] or a[\"oracle\"] != b[\"oracle\"]\r\n                or deviation > 1e-5\r\n            )\r\n        rows.extend(base)\r\n    errors = [row for row in rows\r\n              if row[\"oracle_iou\"] - row[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"repeat_mismatch\": repeat_mismatch,\r\n        \"max_repeat_deviation\": max_repeat_deviation,\r\n        \"oracle_more_concentrated\": sum(\r\n            row[\"oracle_concentration\"] > row[\"selected_concentration\"]\r\n            for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n            mask_bce_loss += F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(pred_mask, tgt_mask.float())\r\n            mask_dice_loss += dice_loss(pred_mask, tgt_mask.float())\r\n        score_loss = score_loss / num_boxes\r\n        mask_bce_loss = mask_bce_loss / num_boxes\r\n        mask_dice_loss = mask_dice_loss / num_boxes\r\n        # score_loss = score_loss / len(pred_masks)\r\n        # mask_bce_loss = mask_bce_loss / len(pred_masks)\r\n        # mask_dice_loss = mask_dice_loss / len(pred_masks)\r\n\r\n        return mask_bce_loss, mask_dice_loss, score_loss\r\n\r\n    def loss_indi(self, pred_indis, targets, indices, num_boxes):\r\n        logits = pred_indis.log_softmax(-1) # [B, Q, 2]\r\n\r\n        # Trick to get target indices across batches\r\n        src_idx = self._get_src_permutation_idx(indices)\r\n\r\n        # positive: [0, 1]\r\n        pos_mask = torch.tensor([0, 1], dtype=torch.float, device=logits.device)\r\n        target_mask = torch.zeros_like(logits) # [B, Q, 2]\r\n        target_mask[:, :, 0] = 1\r\n        target_mask[src_idx] = pos_mask\r\n\r\n        target_sim = torch.zeros_like(logits)\r\n        target_sim[:, :, 0] = 1\r\n        target_sim[src_idx] = pos_mask\r\n\r\n        # STEP Compute entropy\r\n        entropy = torch.log(target_sim + 1e-6) * target_sim\r\n        loss_ce = (entropy - logits * target_sim).sum(-1)\r\n\r\n        # Weight less 'no_object'\r\n        eos_coef = torch.full(\r\n            loss_ce.shape, self.eos_coef,\r\n            device=target_sim.device\r\n        )\r\n        eos_coef[src_idx] = 1\r\n        loss_ce = loss_ce * eos_coef\r\n\r\n        loss_ce = loss_ce.sum() / num_boxes\r\n\r\n        return loss_ce\r\n\r\n    ############################\r\n    # BRIEF semantic alignment #\r\n    ############################\r\n    def loss_sem_align(self, proj_tokens, proj_queries, lang_masks, targets, indices, num_boxes):\r\n        # step 1. Contrastive logits\r\n        norm_text_emb = proj_tokens  # B, num_tokens=L, dim=64\r\n        norm_img_emb = proj_queries  # B, num_queries=256, dim=64\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
